Accordingly, External Development Charges (EDC) if paid to Government of Haryana would be exempt from TDS provisions.
However, in the instant case, it appears that the developer has made the payment in the nature of External Development Charges (EDC) not to the Government but to HUDA [Haryana Urban Development Authority) which is a development authority of State Government of Haryana and is a taxable entity under the income-tax Act, 1961.
